config SND_SOC_A9_ES9218
 tristate "Experimental Hisense A9 ESS APR/MI2S sound card"
 depends on QCOM_APR && I2C && GPIOLIB
 select SND_SOC_QDSP6
 select SND_SOC_QCOM_COMMON
 select SND_SOC_ES9218_A9
 help
   Isolated A9 HiFi playback path. The first backend is 48 kHz stereo S32_LE
   using secondary MI2S with 32-bit serial slots. No SoundWire dependency.
